content.text:
Here's the funder page hero, built around "Fund" as the primary conversion action for this specific page context (the whole page exists to grow funders), while keeping the brand's Activate-first language visible as the secondary path.

**Section outline**

- **Background:** black canvas with layered pink and orange radial glow orbs, subtle 60px grid at 3% opacity
- **Section label:** "FOR FUNDERS" — Inter, pink, uppercase, wide tracking
- **Headline:** "MAKE MORE GOOD POSSIBLE" — Anton, uppercase, white, display size
- **Subheadline:** "Fund real acts before they happen, once or on a recurring basis. When someone activates what you funded, you'll see exactly what it became." — Inter, white/60
- **Locked line treatment:** "Funding makes good possible. Activation makes it personal." set in gradient text, smaller, as an emotional anchor between subhead and CTAs
- **Primary CTA (gradient pill):** "Fund an Act"
- **Secondary CTA (ghost):** "See How Activation Works"
- **Funding-type pills:** "One-time" / "Recurring" — small badges reinforcing flexibility, not a form
- **Floating result card:** a small glass card, upper right, showing the loop a funder can expect: Fund → Deliver → Verified, in the icon-container style, labeled "Sample act, for illustration"

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Gratitude.com — Funder Hero</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { background:#000; font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; }

  .hero {
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    min-height:100vh;
    background-color:#000000;
    overflow:hidden;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
  }

  .grid-overlay {
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:60px 60px;
    opacity:0.3;
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .glow-orb-1 {
    position:absolute;
    top:-10%;
    left:5%;
    width:520px;
    height:520px;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254,49,132,0.35) 0%, rgba(254,49,132,0.08) 40%, transparent 70%);
    filter:blur(40px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .glow-orb-2 {
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-15%;
    right:0%;
    width:600px;
    height:600px;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(236,114,17,0.3) 0%, rgba(236,114,17,0.08) 40%, transparent 70%);
    filter:blur(50px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .container {
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 20px;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:3rem;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width:640px;
    padding:6rem 0;
  }

  .section-label {
    display:inline-block;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#FE3184;
    background:rgba(254,49,132,0.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(254,49,132,0.2);
    border-radius:9999px;
    padding:0.4rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom:1.75rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:72px;
    line-height:0.98;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
    color:#ffffff;
    margin-bottom:1.75rem;
  }

  .subhead {
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.60);
    max-width:520px;
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
  }

  .locked-line {
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.5;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, #FE3184 0%, #FF6B35 50%, #ec7211 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    background-clip:text;
    color:transparent;
    margin-bottom:2.5rem;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:1.25rem;
    margin-bottom:2rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display:inline-block;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FE3184 0%, #FF6B35 50%, #ec7211 100%);
    color:#ffffff;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:1rem 2rem;
    border-radius:9999px;
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(254,49,132,0.3);
    transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(254,49,132,0.4);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display:inline-block;
    background:transparent;
    color:#ffffff;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:1rem 2rem;
    border-radius:9999px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    transition:background 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .pill-row {
    display:flex;
    gap:0.75rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }

  .funding-pill {
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    border-radius:9999px;
    padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Floating result card */
  .result-card {
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    width:320px;
    flex-shrink:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0d0d0d 100%);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius:1rem;
    padding:2rem;
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 60px rgba(254,49,132,0.08);
  }

  .result-card .sample-tag {
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
    display:block;
  }

  .loop-step {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.9rem;
    margin-bottom:1.25rem;
  }
  .loop-step:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }

  .icon-box {
    width:44px;
    height:44px;
    flex-shrink:0;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:rgba(254,49,132,0.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(254,49,132,0.2);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .icon-box svg {
    width:20px;
    height:20px;
    stroke:#FE3184;
    stroke-width:1.5;
    fill:none;
  }

  .loop-text {
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .loop-text strong {
    display:block;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:2px;
  }

  .connector {
    width:1px;
    height:16px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    margin-left:22px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .container {
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:flex-start;
    }
    .result-card {
      width:100%;
      order:2;
    }
    h1 { font-size:52px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-copy { padding:4rem 0 2rem; }
    h1 { font-size:38px; }
    .subhead, .locked-line { font-size:15px; }
    .cta-row { flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:0.9rem; }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
      text-align:center;
      width:100%;
      min-height:44px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .glow-orb-1, .glow-orb-2 { width:320px; height:320px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="grid-overlay"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb-1"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb-2"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="section-label">For Funders</span>
      <h1>Make More<br>Good Possible</h1>
      <p class="subhead">Fund real acts before they happen, once or on a recurring basis. When someone activates what you funded, you'll see exactly what it became.</p>
      <p class="locked-line">Funding makes good possible. Activation makes it personal.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <button class="btn-primary">Fund an Act</button>
        <button class="btn-secondary">See How Activation Works</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pill-row">
        <span class="funding-pill">One-time</span>
        <span class="funding-pill">Recurring</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="result-card">
      <span class="sample-tag">Sample act, for illustration</span>

      <div class="loop-step">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="loop-text"><strong>Fund</strong>Capacity created for a future act</div>
      </div>
      <div class="connector"></div>

      <div class="loop-step">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="loop-text"><strong>Deliver</strong>A trusted nonprofit partner acts</div>
      </div>
      <div class="connector"></div>

      <div class="loop-step">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="loop-text"><strong>Verified</strong>You see what your funding did</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
```

This keeps Fund as the page's dominant action, since that's the whole purpose of a funder page, while the "See How Activation Works" ghost button and the locked line keep the platform's real mechanic honest and visible. All content in the result card is marked as sample, no invented numbers.

